.git
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
PersonalWebsite
SecureGate
DramaFetch
StreamFetch
FullStackHub/screenshots
**/*.log
# Claude Code agents, shifts, scripts and hooks are not part of the image
.claude
**/.claude
# Local env files hold secrets (API keys, JWT secret, database URLs): never in the image. Railway
# builds from git, where they are ignored; a local `docker build` would otherwise copy
# FullStackHub/apps/api/.env or apps/web/.env.local in. The committed .env.example and .env.test
# go too: no build step reads them, and an exception with a wildcard (`!**/.env.example`) would make
# BuildKit walk every folder excluded above (node_modules, .venv, .git, ...) looking for matches.
**/.env
**/.env.*
